NNAGA Plugin Repository license inventory

Catalog metadata, index generation maintenance script, and NNAGA-authored
repository files: GPL-3.0-or-later.

Third-party payloads retain their original license terms. Existing package
manifests record the upstream license metadata. REAPER stock payloads in
packages/jsfx.reaper.* are limited to 40 files with an explicit source-header
GPL grant:

- IXix: 16 files, GPL version 3 or later.
- Liteon: 22 files marked “Released under GPL” in the source header (the
  unspecified GPL version is recorded as GPL).
- LOSER: MGA_JSLimiter and MGA_JSLimiterST, GPL version 3 or later.

These 40 payloads were sourced from the official REAPER 7.77 distribution.
Their package metadata links to https://www.reaper.fm/ as the distribution
source; individual author and license notices remain in the payload files.

No other REAPER stock Effects files are redistributed here. Source headers
and notices remain intact in each payload file.
